  "metadata": {
    "slug": "how-to-release-major-version-in-capgo",
    "title": "How to release major version in capgo",
    "description": "Understand how and when it's necessary to release major version for your app without breaking your user app",
    "author": "Martin Donadieu",
    "author_image_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4084527?v=4",
    "author_url": "https://x.com/martindonadieu",
    "created_at": "2022-08-30 00:00:00+00:00",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-27 16:41:24+00:00",
    "head_image": "/capgo-feature-image.webp",
    "head_image_alt": "How to release major version in capgo Capgo blog illustration",
    "keywords": "mobile app development, live updates, OTA updates, continuous integration, mobile app updates",
    "tag": "Tutorial",
    "published": true,
    "locale": "en",
    "origin": "human",
    "next_blog": "how-to-send-specific-version-to-users"
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 2,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 2,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "When releasing a major version"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 4,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 4,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Versioning can be difficult to manage, usually you want to send a Major update when a major change appears for the users."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 6,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 6,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "But versioning is not made for that, the app store version is different from the Native version."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 8,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 8,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Native version is made to manage breaking change in the "
        },
        {
          "type": "emphasis",
          "location": {
            "line": 8,
            "column": 57
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "location": {
                "line": 8,
                "column": 58
              },
              "text": "code"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 10,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 10,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "In IOS, for example, iOS 16 is the "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 10,
            "column": 36
          },
          "text": "store version"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 10,
            "column": 51
          },
          "text": " of Apple, but the code version is "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 10,
            "column": 86
          },
          "text": "20A5283p"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 10,
            "column": 96
          },
          "text": " (they don't seem to use SemVer there)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 12,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 12,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Now it's clear we don't mix them and use them for what they are made!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 14,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 14,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "Major release"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 16,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 16,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "In your Capacitor app, a major release is necessary when a breaking change happens.\nFor example, a new IOS target (15 to 16), or a new version of Capacitor (3 to 4), or a plugin (1.2 to 2.0) you use have been updated to a major version."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 19,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 19,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "This change means all tooling has to be aligned to handle the breaking change."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 21,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 21,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "That why Capgo follows this system.\nSo if you release a major version, Capgo will not send it to a user who doesn't have it installed from the store."
        },
        {
          "type": "break",
          "location": {
            "line": 22,
            "column": 114
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 23,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "This behavior can be customized. You can learn more about it "
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "location": {
            "line": 23,
            "column": 62
          },
          "url": "/docs/cli/commands/#disable-updates-strategy",
          "title": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "location": {
                "line": 23,
                "column": 63
              },
              "text": "here"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 25,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 3,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 25,
            "column": 5
          },
          "text": "Versions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 27,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 27,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Where Capgo find the version to compare"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 29,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 4,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 29,
            "column": 6
          },
          "text": "IOS"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "location": {
        "line": 30,
        "column": 3
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "location": {
            "line": 30,
            "column": 5
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "location": {
                "line": 30,
                "column": 5
              },
              "text": "Will be used by Capgo to compare to JavaScript version and find Major upgrade"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 32,
        "column": 2
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 32,
            "column": 2
          },
          "text": "In IOS the var is set on your project here "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 32,
            "column": 45
          },
          "text": "ios/App/App/Info.plist"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 32,
            "column": 69
          },
          "text": " under the key"
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 32,
            "column": 83
          },
          "text": "CFBundleShortVersionString"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 32,
            "column": 111
          },
          "text": " or "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 32,
            "column": 115
          },
          "text": "ios/App/App.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 32,
            "column": 154
          },
          "text": " under the key "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 32,
            "column": 169
          },
          "text": "MARKETING_VERSION"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 32,
            "column": 188
          },
          "text": " if "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 32,
            "column": 192
          },
          "text": "MARKETING_VERSION"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 32,
            "column": 211
          },
          "text": " was set in your "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 32,
            "column": 228
          },
          "text": "Info.plist"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 32,
            "column": 240
          },
          "text": " file."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "location": {
        "line": 33,
        "column": 3
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
